    <Fragment slot='caption'>
      The same table, two architectures. On the left, a wholesale grid fuses the knowable frame to
      the unknowable rows, so nothing appears until the bundle and the data both arrive. On the
      right, the frame is server-rendered HTML that shows on the first byte, and a <a
        href='10-suspense-streaming.html'>§10</a
